  "content": {
    "id": "p67-q4-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "A bacterial population $P$ satisfies\n$$\\frac{dP}{dt}=\\frac{P}{8}\\left(1-\\frac{P}{5000}\\right),\\qquad P(0)=1000,$$\nwith $t$ in hours. You may use $\\dfrac{Q}{P(Q-P)}=\\dfrac1P+\\dfrac1{Q-P}$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p67-q4-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Show that $P=\\dfrac{5000}{1+4e^{-t/8}}$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$P=\\dfrac{5000}{1+4e^{-t/8}}$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{dt}{dP}&=\\frac{8}{P\\left(1-\\frac{P}{5000}\\right)}\\\\\\frac{dt}{dP}&=\\frac{8\\cdot5000}{P(5000-P)}\\\\\\frac{dt}{dP}&=8\\left(\\frac1P+\\frac1{5000-P}\\right)\\\\t&=8\\left(\\ln|P|-\\ln|5000-P|\\right)+D\\\\t&=8\\ln\\left|\\frac{P}{5000-P}\\right|+D\\\\\\frac{P}{5000-P}&=Ae^{t/8}\\end{align*}$$\nUsing $P(0)=1000$,\n$$\\begin{align*}A&=\\frac{1000}{4000}\\\\A&=\\frac14.\\end{align*}$$\nHence\n$$\\begin{align*}4P&=(5000-P)e^{t/8}\\\\P(4+e^{t/8})&=5000e^{t/8}\\\\P&=\\frac{5000e^{t/8}}{4+e^{t/8}}\\\\P&=\\frac{5000}{1+4e^{-t/8}}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 73
      },
      {
        "id": "p67-q4-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "If instead $P(0)=6000$, describe what happens to the population as $t$ increases.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "The population decreases and approaches the carrying capacity of 5000 from above.",
          "worked": "For $P>5000$, $1-\\dfrac{P}{5000}<0$, so $\\dfrac{dP}{dt}<0$. Starting from $P(0)=6000$, the population decreases and approaches the carrying capacity of 5000 from above.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      }
    ]
  },
